# Local SQLite database (plus its WAL sidecar files).
# The leading slash anchors this to the repo root — an unanchored "data/"
# also matches src/data/, which silently drops the app's location and fare
# tables from the commit and breaks the production build.
/data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.DS_Store
*.log
.env*
